{"title": "BOOOAL's Benediction (Condition)", "pageid": 6297, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/BOOOAL's_Benediction_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has status properties", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_(Condition)\" title=\"BOOOAL's Blessing (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/56/BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/56/BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"BOOOAL's Blessing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/56/BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_(Condition)\" title=\"BOOOAL's Blessing (Condition)\">BOOOAL's Blessing</a> for an equivalent effect attached to the <a href=\"/wiki/Sickle_of_BOOOAL\" title=\"Sickle of BOOOAL\">Sickle of BOOOAL</a>.</div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/56/BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/56/BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"BOOOAL's Benediction Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/56/BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>BOOOAL's Benediction</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a> against <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bleeding_(Condition)\" title=\"Bleeding (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bleeding\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bleeding_(Condition)\" title=\"Bleeding (Condition)\">Bleeding</a> creatures, as long as there are <a href=\"/wiki/Kuo-toa\" title=\"Kuo-toa\">Kuo-toa</a> to worship <a href=\"/wiki/BOOOAL\" title=\"BOOOAL\">BOOOAL</a>. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>UID: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UND_BOOOALBLESSING</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UND_BOOOALBLESSING+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UND_BOOOALBLESSING+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/IgnoreResting\" title=\"Status properties/IgnoreResting\">IgnoreResting</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/ApplyToDead\" title=\"Status properties/ApplyToDead\">ApplyToDead</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span id=\"Sources_of_BOOOAL.27s_Benediction\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_BOOOAL's_Benediction\">Sources of BOOOAL's Benediction</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Sacrificing a true <a href=\"/wiki/Companion\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Companion\">companion</a> to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/BOOOAL\" title=\"BOOOAL\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Portrait_BOOOAL.png/25px-Portrait_BOOOAL.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Portrait_BOOOAL.png/38px-Portrait_BOOOAL.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Portrait_BOOOAL.png/50px-Portrait_BOOOAL.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"BOOOAL\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Portrait_BOOOAL.png/25px-Portrait_BOOOAL.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Portrait_BOOOAL.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/BOOOAL\" title=\"BOOOAL\">BOOOAL</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>There must be at least two companions in the party, one of which can be a <a href=\"/wiki/Hirelings\" title=\"Hirelings\">hireling</a>, for the dialogue choice to sacrifice a companion to appear.</li>\n<li>It is possible to get this buff without having to sacrifice a companion with the following steps:\n<ol><li>Lure <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pooldripp\" title=\"Pooldripp\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Pooldripp.png/25px-Portrait_Pooldripp.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Pooldripp.png/38px-Portrait_Pooldripp.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Pooldripp.png/50px-Portrait_Pooldripp.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pooldripp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Pooldripp.png/25px-Portrait_Pooldripp.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Portrait_Pooldripp.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Pooldripp\" title=\"Pooldripp\">Pooldripp</a> away from the altar (for instance: up the path toward the exit to the Underdark) with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Minor_Illusion\" title=\"Minor Illusion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Minor_Illusion_Icon.webp/20px-Minor_Illusion_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Minor_Illusion_Icon.webp/30px-Minor_Illusion_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Minor_Illusion_Icon.webp/40px-Minor_Illusion_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Minor Illusion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Minor_Illusion_Icon.webp/20px-Minor_Illusion_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9d/Minor_Illusion_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Minor_Illusion\" title=\"Minor Illusion\">Minor Illusion</a> or other non-violent means. He goes back to the altar after investigating. If Pooldripp is not lured away, the cutscene for this event begins upon any character approaching the altar, even if <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Invisible_(Condition)\" title=\"Invisible (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Invisible\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Invisible_(Condition)\" title=\"Invisible (Condition)\">Invisible</a>.</li>\n<li>Pickpocket the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sickle_of_BOOOAL\" title=\"Sickle of BOOOAL\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Sickle_of_BOOOAL_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Sickle_of_BOOOAL_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Sickle_of_BOOOAL_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Sickle_of_BOOOAL_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Sickle_of_BOOOAL_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Sickle_of_BOOOAL_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Sickle_of_BOOOAL_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Sickle_of_BOOOAL_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Sickle_of_BOOOAL_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sickle_of_BOOOAL\" title=\"Sickle of BOOOAL\">Sickle of BOOOAL</a> off Pooldripp, and avoid him until he resumes worshipping.</li>\n<li>Trigger the cutscene near the altar.</li>\n<li>Navigate the dialogue choices to either persuade BOOOAL that the player character can <i>\"kill many more in your name\"</i>; or identify him as a <i>\"rabid little fey creature\"</i> and then say <i>[To priest] to \"bow before BOOOAL's chosen\"</i>.</li></ol></li>\n<li>Earning BOOOAL's Benediction grants the party experience as if BOOAL and all his worshipers are defeated.</li>\n<li>This buff persists through <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dead_(Condition)\" title=\"Dead (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d5/Dead_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Dead_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d5/Dead_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Dead_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d5/Dead_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Dead_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"death\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d5/Dead_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Dead_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d5/Dead_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dead_(Condition)\" title=\"Dead (Condition)\">death</a> and is only removed if all of the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Kuo-toa\" title=\"Kuo-toa\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Portrait_Kuo-toa_%28creature%29.png/25px-Portrait_Kuo-toa_%28creature%29.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fa/Portrait_Kuo-toa_%28creature%29.png/38px-Portrait_Kuo-toa_%28creature%29.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fa/Portrait_Kuo-toa_%28creature%29.png/50px-Portrait_Kuo-toa_%28creature%29.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Kuo-toa\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Portrait_Kuo-toa_%28creature%29.png/25px-Portrait_Kuo-toa_%28creature%29.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fa/Portrait_Kuo-toa_%28creature%29.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Kuo-toa\" title=\"Kuo-toa\">Kuo-toa</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/The_Festering_Cove\" title=\"The Festering Cove\">The Festering Cove</a> are killed.</li>\n<li>Only characters who are present and in the active party at the moment the Benediction is triggered receive the buff. Those at camp or outside the party roster do not, and the effect cannot be reapplied later.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195311\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.097 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.108 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3568/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 34064/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 16800/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops c